<title>FRANCE: French housing starts up 0.8 pct in April.</title>
<headline>French housing starts up 0.8 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts to end April 1997.</p>
<p>			     3-mths to end  12-mths to end</p>
<p>				 April 1997     April 1997</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  70,600	  300,200</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -8.3	     -2.2</p>
<p> STARTED			72,400	  270,200</p>
<p> (percent)			 0.8	     -3.8</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		 7.21 million	32.32 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -7.6	     -6.2</p>
<p> STARTED		     6.56 million	29.65 million</p>
<p> percent			 -11.8	     -6.3</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
